---
description: Strapi 5 backend rules
globs:
  - "apps/backend/**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Follow Strapi 5 conventions and generated project structure.
- Use Document Service API for custom data access.
- Do not introduce new Entity Service API usage.
- Keep database and secret config environment-driven.
- Enforce author ownership on the backend.
- Public APIs should expose only published articles unless explicitly documented.
- Do not hand-edit generated Strapi type files.
